# Install xCAT Provisioner

{% include "provisioner/provisioner.md.j2" %}

This guide provisions compute nodes in **stateful** (*diskful*) mode: a base OS is
installed onto each node's local disk, then OpenHPC components are added to the
running nodes over `xdsh`. Nodes keep their state across reboots. The compute
nodes are installed and booted during this chapter.

